# 启动脚本依赖 UTF-8 BOM:PowerShell 5.1 在无 BOM 时会按 GBK 解码中文,
# 导致 Write-Host "[step] ..." 中的中文乱码,使 [ 被误解析为数组索引。
# 标记为 -text 让 git 按二进制原样存储 BOM 字节,不做行尾转换。
start.ps1 -text
start.bat -text

# GitHub rejects ordinary Git blobs larger than 100 MiB. The retained homepage
# video is a required frontend asset, so store MP4 payloads through Git LFS.
*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
